<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change into a man,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				176
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				943
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rear up into manhood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.419
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.490a
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become a man, reach manhood,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				13.3
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διθύραμβοι ἠνδρωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Macho
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.341c
			</span></i>: also in 
				Med.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγενέσθαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, also of a woman, <i>virum experta sum,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνδρώθησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					87.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνδρωμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					67.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
